1
00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:13,000
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,039 --> 00:01:15,900
[Episode 1]

3
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:21,740
[Psychiatric Hospital]

4
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:36,660
[Actor Zhang Hao]

5
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:37,479
[Truth and Lies Intertwine
at Mercy Hospital]

6
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:38,530
[The Deadly Game Between Actor Zhang Hao
and the Mysterious Shadow]

7
00:01:39,450 --> 00:01:40,870
Zhang Hao...

8
00:01:42,150 --> 00:01:42,490
[Yingcheng Morning News]

9
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,280
Has she really lost her mind?

10
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,840
Paranoid disorder.

11
00:01:58,320 --> 00:02:00,790
[Final Diagnosis: Paranoid Disorder]

12
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:07,390
[10,000 yuan]

13
00:02:07,690 --> 00:02:09,590
I'm counting on you
to look after my ex-wife.

14
00:02:09,590 --> 00:02:10,190
Of course.

15
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:36,590
Don't worry.

16
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:38,970
I'll find you a doctor

17
00:02:39,420 --> 00:02:41,150
and get you the best treatment.

18
00:02:41,910 --> 00:02:43,240
Just stay here

19
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,520
and keep my secret.

20
00:02:48,079 --> 00:02:49,210
Oh, I almost forgot.

21
00:02:49,310 --> 00:02:50,840
Even if you told anyone now,

22
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:53,290
they'd just think you were raving.

23
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,260
You finally came to see me.

24
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:45,490
Do you know how long I've been waiting?

25
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:48,400
It wasn't easy making you believe

26
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:49,430
I was crazy.

27
00:03:49,870 --> 00:03:50,820
But

28
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:52,560
after all this time,

29
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,030
it was worth it.

30
00:03:56,750 --> 00:03:57,630
What's wrong?

31
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:00,260
Do you have something to say to me?

32
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:01,810
I was wrong.

33
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:03,080
Please let me go.

34
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:14,060
If I killed you just like that,

35
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:17,160
what would happen to my face?

36
00:04:17,980 --> 00:04:19,360
You know,

37
00:04:20,329 --> 00:04:23,150
every time I see you on TV,

38
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:26,250
my face starts to ache.

39
00:04:26,510 --> 00:04:28,750
When you're out there
with that face everyone adores,

40
00:04:28,750 --> 00:04:30,280
have you ever thought about

41
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:32,840
how much I contributed to it?

42
00:04:33,390 --> 00:04:34,310
I'll give you

43
00:04:34,390 --> 00:04:35,450
anything you want.

44
00:04:36,390 --> 00:04:37,920
I don't want anything.

45
00:04:38,830 --> 00:04:41,040
All I want is your skin,

46
00:04:42,390 --> 00:04:43,409
Xiao.

47
00:04:50,159 --> 00:04:51,140
He's hurt.

48
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:52,159
Cut!

49
00:04:53,070 --> 00:04:55,200
Come touch up Mr. Zhao's wound makeup.

50
00:04:55,630 --> 00:04:56,190
Go check on him.

51
00:04:56,190 --> 00:04:56,990
What's wrong?

52
00:05:00,430 --> 00:05:01,790
Get away from him.

53
00:05:02,270 --> 00:05:02,990
Xiao.

54
00:05:03,070 --> 00:05:03,960
Are you okay?

55
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,040
Let me see.

56
00:05:07,190 --> 00:05:08,430
You've got a cut.

57
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,360
I'm fine. Just a minor scrape.

58
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:11,870
This scar looks pretty good.

59
00:05:11,870 --> 00:05:13,190
Tell them to go with this one.

60
00:05:13,190 --> 00:05:13,720
Okay,

61
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:14,240
will do.

62
00:05:15,870 --> 00:05:17,480
What kind of work are you people doing?

63
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:19,140
Why is the prop knife so sharp?

64
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:21,920
-Don't get upset. Calm down.
-Xiao's face is insured, you know!

65
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:22,520
Director.

66
00:05:22,810 --> 00:05:23,950
I'm sorry, Mr. Zhao.

67
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:25,720
You were acting so well just now

68
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:27,430
that I got completely carried away

69
00:05:27,430 --> 00:05:29,720
and didn't control my strength.

70
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:30,920
Thank you, Director.

71
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,150
But you were acting

72
00:05:32,390 --> 00:05:34,590
like a professional yourself just now.

73
00:05:34,830 --> 00:05:35,760
You're too kind.

74
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:39,430
I wrote the script myself, after all.

75
00:05:39,430 --> 00:05:40,690
You wrote it yourself?

76
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:43,159
But I think you got

77
00:05:43,159 --> 00:05:44,490
one line wrong just now.

78
00:05:45,270 --> 00:05:47,070
The male lead isn't called Xiao.

79
00:05:48,190 --> 00:05:49,120
Really?

80
00:05:51,100 --> 00:05:52,960
Must've been a slip of the tongue.

81
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:55,159
Excuse me.

82
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:57,150
Ms. Du will be ready shortly.

83
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,450
Mr. Zhao, please take a little break.

84
00:05:58,450 --> 00:05:59,750
We'll get started soon.

85
00:05:59,750 --> 00:06:00,800
Get ready.

86
00:06:02,950 --> 00:06:03,800
-Let's do it.
-No need for a rehearsal.

87
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:05,270
Let's go straight into the scene.

88
00:06:05,270 --> 00:06:05,950
Wardrobe and makeup,

89
00:06:05,950 --> 00:06:07,750
anything that needs adjusting?

90
00:06:09,950 --> 00:06:12,050
Xu Jing may be a new director,

91
00:06:12,190 --> 00:06:14,390
but she must have some serious backing.

92
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:17,240
Du Chunqing used to work
only on TV dramas and movies,

93
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:20,300
but now she's doing short-form dramas
just for Xu Jing.

94
00:06:20,390 --> 00:06:21,510
I hear

95
00:06:21,510 --> 00:06:24,170
Xu Jing has some major productions
backing her.

96
00:06:24,270 --> 00:06:26,000
You should get on her good side.

97
00:06:27,830 --> 00:06:28,430
Rolling.

98
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:30,510
Scene 2, Shot 3, Take 1!

99
00:06:29,540 --> 00:06:30,730
[The Husband's Trap]

100
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,580
If I killed you just like that,

101
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:43,159
what would happen to my face?

102
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:18,880
It's been 10 years,

103
00:07:19,830 --> 00:07:21,210
and I'm back here again.

104
00:07:22,190 --> 00:07:24,120
They still haven't fixed
the broken bricks in the wall.

105
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:25,080
Are you nervous?

106
00:07:25,950 --> 00:07:28,150
I remember the first time I came here...

107
00:07:29,430 --> 00:07:30,430
I'm not nervous.

108
00:07:31,830 --> 00:07:33,890
I'm just afraid of seeing you in pain.

109
00:07:35,430 --> 00:07:37,220
It's bound to hurt,

110
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:40,060
but seeing you smile
will make it all go away.

111
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:46,960
Don't be nervous.

112
00:07:47,159 --> 00:07:48,480
It's just a skin graft.

113
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:50,409
I can cover it up with makeup later.

114
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:57,290
Mr. Zhao, Mrs. Zhao,

115
00:07:57,630 --> 00:08:00,160
the skin graft procedure
will begin shortly.

116
00:08:00,270 --> 00:08:02,000
All the Shen family's businesses

117
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:03,930
and accounts are now under my name.

118
00:08:05,190 --> 00:08:06,110
And you?

119
00:08:06,310 --> 00:08:08,000
You can't even gather enough people.

120
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:10,240
The Shen family doesn't acknowledge me?

121
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:12,170
Who do you think you are to say that?

122
00:08:18,790 --> 00:08:23,750
[Nurses' Station]

123
00:09:28,790 --> 00:09:29,450
Don't move.

124
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:32,400
Your wound still needs
to be dressed and cared for.

125
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:35,600
Um,

126
00:09:36,030 --> 00:09:37,160
where is my husband?

127
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:38,870
When is he coming to pick me up?

128
00:09:38,870 --> 00:09:40,440
Mr. Zhao has already been discharged.

129
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:43,300
He said he'd arrange for someone
to come pick you up.

130
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:44,920
Arrange for someone?

131
00:09:46,600 --> 00:09:48,660
Why isn't he coming to get me himself?

132
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:05,780
His phone is switched off.

133
00:10:06,870 --> 00:10:08,200
Maybe the battery died?

134
00:10:08,670 --> 00:10:11,080
Zhao Xiao, once one of the most popular
actors of his time, suffered

135
00:10:10,140 --> 00:10:11,530
[Film Star Zhao Xiao Makes a Comeback]

136
00:10:11,110 --> 00:10:14,080
a horrific car accident 2.5 years ago
that left him disfigured.

137
00:10:11,530 --> 00:10:12,120
[Film Star Zhao Xiao
Announces His Comeback]

138
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:16,010
His acting career hit rock bottom.

139
00:10:16,220 --> 00:10:19,240
Recently, his manager made
a high-profile announcement to the media

140
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:21,700
that he would officially return
in 3 months.

141
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:22,510
This afternoon,

142
00:10:22,510 --> 00:10:25,480
Zhao Xiao made his first public appearance
at a film and TV studio,

143
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:28,610
where a large crowd of fans
had gathered early to see him.

144
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:31,910
-Xiao!
-Xiao!

145
00:10:31,930 --> 00:10:34,720
-Xiao!
-Xiao!

146
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:37,190
Xiao, I love you!

147
00:10:36,890 --> 00:10:39,610
[Welcome back, Xiao.]

148
00:10:37,210 --> 00:10:39,750
-Xiao!
-Xiao!

149
00:10:39,640 --> 00:10:42,230
[Zhao Xiao's Dreams Take Flight;
Our Love for Xiao Knows No Bounds]

150
00:10:39,790 --> 00:10:42,930
-Xiao!
-Xiao!

151
00:10:44,270 --> 00:10:46,030
After waiting for more than 2 years,

152
00:10:46,030 --> 00:10:47,870
fans finally got to see him today.

153
00:10:47,870 --> 00:10:49,150
Zhao Xiao looks great,

154
00:10:49,150 --> 00:10:51,150
with no visible signs
of his past injuries.

155
00:10:51,150 --> 00:10:53,720
Judging by the enthusiastic response
from the fans at the scene,

156
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:56,550
Zhao Xiao still has tremendous star power.

157
00:11:01,270 --> 00:11:02,800
Xiao has made his comeback.

158
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:04,350
The surgery was a success.

159
00:11:04,350 --> 00:11:05,840
Xiao, what kept you

160
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:07,670
going through the most difficult time
in your life?

161
00:11:07,670 --> 00:11:09,560
I think it was my passion for acting

162
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:11,030
and my hope for the future.

163
00:11:11,030 --> 00:11:12,550
I hear you had to make great sacrifices

164
00:11:12,550 --> 00:11:13,670
for this surgery.

165
00:11:13,670 --> 00:11:14,470
That's right.

166
00:11:14,750 --> 00:11:16,210
This experience taught me

167
00:11:16,270 --> 00:11:18,150
to face hardships on my own.

168
00:11:18,550 --> 00:11:20,160
It's helped me grow a lot.

169
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,990
On your own...

170
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:23,630
What about your family?

171
00:11:23,630 --> 00:11:25,360
Any progress in your love life?

172
00:11:25,910 --> 00:11:27,910
After everything that's happened,

173
00:11:28,640 --> 00:11:30,550
I'll be devoting all my time and energy

174
00:11:30,550 --> 00:11:32,790
to my career from now on.

175
00:11:35,030 --> 00:11:36,290
As for relationships,

176
00:11:36,610 --> 00:11:37,840
I'll think about that another time.

177
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:38,720
Thank you, Xiao.

178
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:41,530
-Xiao!
-Xiao, I love you!

179
00:11:41,550 --> 00:11:44,210
-Xiao!
-Xiao!

180
00:11:46,270 --> 00:11:48,510
-Xiao!
-Xiao, you're so handsome!

181
00:11:48,510 --> 00:11:50,270
I love you, Xiao!

182
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,730
You should get some rest first.

183
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:11,240
My face...

184
00:12:12,030 --> 00:12:14,690
Wasn't it supposed to be
just a small skin graft?

185
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:20,240
Your wound

186
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:21,630
still can't be exposed to the air.

187
00:12:21,630 --> 00:12:23,290
Let me dress it for you, okay?

188
00:12:23,390 --> 00:12:24,000
No!

189
00:12:24,150 --> 00:12:26,480
-Please calm down.
-No! I want to see Xiao.

190
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:28,450
-I want to ask him why.
-Doctor!

191
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:29,910
Doctor!

192
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:47,560
No...

193
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:49,490
Stop lying to me...
